  "label": "User projected onto the cartoon character as 'a little savage'",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the cartoon character dressed in stereotypical Native American attire, who is being labeled as 'a little savage' by the text. The meme invites the user to identify with or see themselves as the character embodying this derogatory stereotype, even though the character is a visual representation of a harmful racial trope. The projection is implicit through the meme's framing, where the viewer is positioned as the observer of the 'savage' behavior, and by extension, the user is invited to project their own identity or behavior onto the character's portrayal.",
